{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_006","page_order":6,"source_text":"シュタルク様。何か欲しい物とかありますか？","source_box":[311,267,397,437],"block_id":"ocr_0008_97f34108","source_hash":"52bb52f89f451aa6","reference_text":"Stark-sama is there anything you desire?","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_007","page_order":7,"source_text":"なんで？","source_box":[87,284,112,370],"block_id":"ocr_0009_faf30e80","source_hash":"63536a29fd6d528b","reference_text":"How come?","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_008","page_order":8,"source_text":"今日がシュタルク様の誕生日だからです。","source_box":[686,549,746,759],"block_id":"ocr_0010_60b018ff","source_hash":"ee39a61b4149a3e5","reference_text":"Today is Stark-sama's birthday.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_009","page_order":9,"source_text":"そうだっけ。","source_box":[376,554,396,670],"block_id":"ocr_0011_8ffdf006","source_hash":"965a3cd3a3951c69","reference_text":"Oh right.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_010","page_order":10,"source_text":"それと欲しい物になんの関係があるんだ？","source_box":[270,616,351,789],"block_id":"ocr_0012_d9a7ec76","source_hash":"5ef6b0d106a06b25","reference_text":"And what does that have to do with what I desire?","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_011","page_order":11,"source_text":"シュタルク様の誕生日プレゼントです。","source_box":[641,861,702,1082],"block_id":"ocr_0013_21390f2e","source_hash":"7434b92bedc1cae7","reference_text":"It will be Stark-sama's birthday present.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_012","page_order":12,"source_text":"やっぱりなんかムカつくからあげない。","source_box":[253,870,335,1080],"block_id":"ocr_0015_594280ec","source_hash":"9b7cc74aea3983c4","reference_text":"...You do anger me after all. Forget about it.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_008","line_id":"008_013","page_order":13,"source_text":"え？何かくれんの？","source_box":[431,1065,520,1181],"block_id":"ocr_0014_013433b1","source_hash":"8717e52cbce50e53","reference_text":"Eh? You're giving me something?","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_001","page_order":1,"source_text":"いやふざけていたわけじゃなくて．．．","source_box":[651,110,730,279],"block_id":"ocr_0001_360393a4","source_hash":"7b16eb4f7681a5a3","reference_text":"No, I wasn't trying to joke around...","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_002","page_order":2,"source_text":"俺、誕生日にプレゼントとか貰ったことないんだ。死んだ故郷の家族からも師匠からち貰ったことがないから、そういうもんなのかと思っていた。","source_box":[359,39,562,437],"block_id":"render_0002_c6939900","source_hash":"61b36b0badb8a5cb","reference_text":"I have never received anything for my borthday before. I have never received anything from my late family back in my home or from Master, so I was wondering if that's how it goes.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_003","page_order":3,"source_text":"故郷の家族からも？そういった風習だったのですか？","source_box":[94,29,219,243],"block_id":"render_0003_fac43fd5","source_hash":"d90578e1d75c1755","reference_text":"Even your family from your home town? Was that the sort of custom you lived with?","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_004","page_order":4,"source_text":"いや。単に俺が大事にされていなかったんだろうな。","source_box":[630,507,739,697],"block_id":"ocr_0006_b82c7dc6","source_hash":"d9e34f91abb15d1b","reference_text":"No. I was simply never valued highly.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_005","page_order":5,"source_text":"俺の故郷は戦士の村でさ。弱い奴の居場所なんかなかった。","source_box":[179,526,297,685],"block_id":"ocr_0007_d7147905","source_hash":"76d77cbc7ba4ffd0","reference_text":"I came from a town of warriors. It was no place for weaklings.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_006","page_order":6,"source_text":"魔物相手になんたる様だ。シュトルツを見習え。","source_box":[474,921,590,1177],"block_id":"render_0006_1ceba97d","source_hash":"0e0480f564ccb358","reference_text":"What a mess you lot are against a monster. Learn from Stolz.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_009","line_id":"009_007","page_order":7,"source_text":"怪我どころか返り血一つ、泥一つさえ跳ねていない。","source_box":[92,976,219,1113],"block_id":"ocr_0010_0091b2d3","source_hash":"05e382e7e8a88e33","reference_text":"Let alone an injury, he has not caused a single bit of blood or mud to splatter on him.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_001","page_order":1,"source_text":"汚れ一つない白い外套はこの村最強の戦士の証。","source_box":[452,321,582,484],"block_id":"ocr_0001_23feea9b","source_hash":"d871a3a6e3acad31","reference_text":"That unsullied white cloak of yours is proof that you are the most powerful warrior of this village.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_002","page_order":2,"source_text":"シュトルツはこの村の誇りだ。","source_box":[316,326,371,483],"block_id":"ocr_0002_19b4125b","source_hash":"52554529d339a81d","reference_text":"You are the pride of this village, Stolz.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_003","page_order":3,"source_text":"当然だ親父。","source_box":[46,502,113,576],"block_id":"ocr_0003_cbe2329b","source_hash":"8b0265a8f63b1ace","reference_text":"Naturally, Father.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_004","page_order":4,"source_text":"それに比べてシュタルク。あいつは失敗作だ。","source_box":[534,686,619,864],"block_id":"ocr_0004_0e6f3130","source_hash":"49b0da4fc25342e6","reference_text":"And yet compared to you, there is Stark. He is a reject.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_005","page_order":5,"source_text":"毎日あれだけ修行しているというのに、","source_box":[340,658,429,787],"block_id":"ocr_0005_18185ba3","source_hash":"03a3de6ebd385fae","reference_text":"Even though he trains that much every day.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
{"page_id":"frieren_ch26_010","line_id":"010_006","page_order":6,"source_text":"まだ一度も魔物とまともに戦えていない。","source_box":[52,658,145,807],"block_id":"ocr_0006_287829aa","source_hash":"4057d58624fb298e","reference_text":"He is still unable to fight monsters seriously.","alignment_confidence":"high","reference_role":"speech","skip_reference":false,"skip_reason":"","notes":""}
